; The arcade "GO ▶" prompt, shown by SectionGate once the section's last enemy is down. Word and
; arrow live under one Control so HUD's blink fades both with a single Modulate; the arrow is a
; Polygon2D rather than a glyph because the HUD theme uses Godot's default font, which carries no
; U+25B6. Anchored to the right edge at mid height — where the player is looking when he is told to
; move on, and clear of the energy panel (top left) and the interaction prompt (bottom centre).
